    "persona_semantic_units": [
      {
        "id": "su-persona-The-Magician-p1",
        "kind": "persona-semantic",
        "source_elements": [
          "how-1",
          "how-0",
          "how-2",
          "result-0"
        ],
        "search_text": "The system's alarm was activated when the grid orchestrator placed a major island region under red alert. This emergency response followed a critical mechanism failing: the initial trigger event where a vulnerable generating asset tripped offline. With pre-existing equipment downtime and a climate-induced demand surge creating high demand, the crisis decision-makers acted. They initiated a managed intervention to prevent collapse, executing emergency power rationing as a deliberate, surgical unloading of the grid. The result was a massive power deficit exposed, leaving significant capacity loss.",
        "persona_id": "The-Magician",
        "center_element": "how-1",
        "supporting_elements": [
          "how-0",
          "how-1",
          "how-2",
          "result-0"
        ],
        "fit": 0.91
      },
      {
        "id": "su-persona-The-Magician-p2",
        "kind": "persona-semantic",
        "source_elements": [
          "why-2",
          "why-0",
          "why-1",
          "how-1"
        ],
        "search_text": "Behind the grid's critical pressure point lay a hidden lever of demand pressure: a climate-induced demand surge from seasonal heat. This energy demand spike, interacting with systemic fragility revealed by other long-running plant outages, pushed the energy sector entity into a thin operating margin. The cascading network of generators faced multiple power plants with pre-existing equipment downtime, all while the grid orchestrator managed the crisis. A high-level grid warning was issued as part of the grid management action.",
        "persona_id": "The-Magician",
        "center_element": "why-2",
        "supporting_elements": [
          "why-0",
          "why-1",
          "why-2",
          "how-1"
        ],
        "fit": 0.87
      },
      {
        "id": "su-persona-The-Magician-p3",
        "kind": "persona-semantic",
        "source_elements": [
          "how-2",
          "why-0",
          "result-0"
        ],
        "search_text": "To keep a critical transmission line from overloading, the public authorities ordered a managed intervention to prevent collapse. This load shedding, an emergency measure, involved a deliberate, surgical unloading of the grid, a control action to ensure grid stabilization. The energy deficit exposed by this crisis stemmed from a single point of failure and a power shortage, with a plant malfunction as the initial trigger. The grid's central nervous system coordinated this response to the massive power deficit.",
        "persona_id": "The-Magician",
        "center_element": "how-2",
        "supporting_elements": [
          "how-2",
          "why-0",
          "result-0"
        ],
        "fit": 0.84
      }
    ]
